<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan bank operation gets 50 mln rupees.</title>
<headline>Pakistan bank operation gets 50 mln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank said it had accepted 50 million rupees in an open market operation in Short-Term Federal Bonds on Wednesday. Figures in brackets show results of the last operation on September 12.</p>
<p>		    Offered	 Accepted	Max cut-off</p>
<p>Outright sales     50 (1,500)  50 (1,500)   13.50 pct/yr(13.40)</p>
<p>Five-month repo   nil	     nil	   nil</p>
<p>Three-month repo  nil	     nil	   nil</p>
<p>One-month repo    nil	     nil	   nil</p>
<p>Total(million rupees) 50		50</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
